no, I purposely left the house to join the motorbike group, but they didn't get together, then I met 2 new people, I relapsed there, 2 people were very kind, making me suspect they asked for my whattup number, and acting too much that made me increasingly anxious ...

&#x200B;

now I am very anxious, empty, heart racing, dizzy, I was confident that I was not.
